{
  "abstract": "{\"id\":\"tools.app_management.extend_package.create\",\"title\":\"创建安卓应用分包\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/app_management/extend_package/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"capability_summary\":\"通过客户id和应用包id，为应用包创建对应的分包信息。目前开放平台不支持母包package的创建，需前往投放平台创建，母包创建成功后可通过此接口创建分包。单个package目前支持分包上限3000个，单次创建分包数量上限是100。关键配合接口有【获取Access-Token】、【查询应用信息】、【附录-返回码】。\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"reason\":\"创建安卓应用分包需要授权access-token，获取方法见此接口文档\"},{\"id\":\"query.app_info\",\"title\":\"查询应用信息\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710742760448\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"reason\":\"创建安卓应用分包需要应用包ID，获取方法见此接口文档\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return_code\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"reason\":\"创建安卓应用分包的应答字段中返回码和返回信息的说明见此接口文档\"}]}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Kzwi6McU\">通过客户id和应用包id，为应用包创建对应的分包信息。</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-VBD1BQ0J\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AV3er8ff\">目前开放平台不支持母包package的创建，创建母包需要前往 <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/app_package/applist?aadvid=4645318181\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">投放平台-资产-移动应用</a> ；<br/>母包package创建成功后，可以通过当前接口创建分包。</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-lJrtcAEg%5C%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E4%B8%AApackage%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%903000%E4%B8%AA%EF%BC%9B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-ntbPZR1m%5C%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E6%AC%A1%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%E6%98%AF100%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BJqs5%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-lJrtcAEg%5C%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E4%B8%AApackage%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%903000%E4%B8%AA%EF%BC%9B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-ntbPZR1m%5C%22%3E%E5%8D%95%E6%AC%A1%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%88%86%E5%8C%85%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%E6%98%AF100%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 1