-0iRzH3v9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-99hnokyB\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-QmDVPP42\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xcc0AIVE\">授权access-token，获取方法见接口文档<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【获取Access-Token】</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-kPLFirrP\" id=\"link-3\">请求参数</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-Eg5QYBKx\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-S1fg3gif\"><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-2uE16Q2L\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-gZjyooRi\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-eBGpGiuU\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-8qbfWlW0\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ZKZx5heb\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-bio4ASM6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1wexD48j\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-nJfQ3UJ2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lYHWhec3\">类型<