k-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5qg4xk9o\">channel_count</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-ya5P3MBZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-E8nj5SyE\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-GaiziOmh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cLuuNwed\">创建数量，（mode=<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">Auto</code>时需指定）单次分包取值范围<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">1~100</code></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-AuOdFbA6\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-qwcgrxVy\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iGnV1qrg\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\"></span>channel_list</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-LE74nATa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-abd0q6Ps\">object[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-9JBmtwJw\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-egLFs1TP\">自定义渠道号信息，（mode=<code style=\"f